<title>USA: CPI says 4,446,138 shares tendered in offer.</title>
<headline>CPI says 4,446,138 shares tendered in offer.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>CPI Corp said Tuesday that 4,446,138 shares were tendered and not withdrawn at $19 a share, based on a preliminary results of its Dutch auction tender offer that expired Monday.</p>
<p>CPI said it expects preliminarily to purchase 2,250,000 shares at a price representing approximately 51 percent of the shares tendered at the $19 a share price.  </p>
<p>CPI, a consumer services company, said the actual purchase price and final proration factor is subject to final confirmation and the proper delivery of all shares tendered and not withdrawn.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
